title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP15005","armor":"WP1010005","helmet":"WP1021205"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10115","name":{"zh":"征讨南蛮","en":"Southern Campaign"},"year":"225","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1029","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[91,73,77,71,80,83],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP15005","armor":"WP1010005","helmet":"WP1021205"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10915","name":{"zh":"北伐中原","en":"Northern Expedition"},"year":"227","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10127","city":"CS1029","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[91,73,77,71,80,83],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"99","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP15005","armor":"WP1010005","helmet":"WP1021205"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11015","name":{"zh":"再出岐山","en":"Return to Qishan"},"year":"231","month":"1"},"faction":"WJ10127","city":"CS1029","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[91,73,77,71,80,83],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"99","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP15005","armor":"WP1010005","helmet":"WP1021205"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11115","name":{"zh":"五丈原","en":"Wuzhang Plains"},"year":"234","month":"1"},"faction":"WJ10127","city":"CS1029","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[91,73,77,71,80,83],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"99","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP15005","armor":"WP1010005","helmet":"WP1021205"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":"WJ1000115","city":"CS1029","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":3,"stats":[91,73,77,71,80,83],"title":-1,"rank":"5","loyalty":"99","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP15005","armor":"WP1010005","helmet":"WP1021205"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1029","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":3,"stats":[91,73,77,71,80,83],"title":-1,"rank":"5","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP15005","armor":"WP1010005","helmet":"WP1021205"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10005","city":"CS1028","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[91,73,77,71,80,83],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP15005","armor":"WP1010005","helmet":"WP1021205"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"西晋名将。出身世家，博学多闻，容颜英俊，多谋善战。早年任河东从事，后受征南将军羊祜征辟，参征南军事，羊祜以深交知己待他。年近七旬被任命为益州刺史，奉晋武帝之命秘密建造战船。晋伐吴时与唐彬沿长江向下破吴，并击败了张象，率先攻取石头城，接受吴末帝孙皓投降，完成西晋统一大业。官至辅国大将军。但因率先受降孙皓引发上司王浑忌恨。晋武帝最终虽表面追责，实则默认其功，太康六年病逝，谥武侯。","tc":"西晉名將。出身世家，博學多聞，容顏英俊，多謀善戰。早年任河東從事，后受征南將軍羊祜征辟，參征南軍事，羊祜以深交知己待他。年近七旬被任命為益州刺史，奉晉武帝之命秘密建造戰船。晉伐吳時與唐彬沿長江向下破吳，并擊敗了張象，率先攻取石頭城，接受吳末帝孫皓投降，完成西晉統一大業。官至輔國大將軍。但因率先受降孫皓引發上司王渾忌恨。晉武帝最終雖表面追責，實則默認其功，太康六年病逝，謚武侯。","en":"A celebrated general of Western Jin. Born into an eminent family, broadly learned, handsome, and skilled in both strategy and combat. He began his career as an aide in Hedong and was later recruited by South Off. (conquest) Yang Hu, who treated him as a close confidant. Appointed Lt. Governor of Yi Province at nearly seventy, he was tasked by Emperor Wu of Jin with secretly constructing warships. During the Jin conquest of Wu, he and Tang Bin sailed down the Yangtze, defeating Zhang Xiang and becoming the first to capture Shitou Castle, where he accepted the surrender of the last Wu emperor Sun Hao, completing the reunification under Jin. He rose to the rank of Grand General Who Assists the State. However, his being the first to accept Sun Hao's surrender drew the jealousy of his superior Wang Hun. Though Emperor Wu of Jin formally reprimanded him, he tacitly acknowledged Wang Jun's achievement. Wang Jun died in the sixth year of Taikang, with the posthumous title Marquis Wu.","jp":"西晋の名将。名門の出身で、博学多聞にして容姿端麗、知謀に長け戦上手であった。若くして河東従事を務め、のちに征南将軍の羊祜に招聘されて征南軍事に参じると、羊祜から深い知己として遇された。七十近くになって益州刺史に任じられ、晋の武帝の命を受けて密かに戦船を建設した。晋の呉討伐の際には唐彬とともに長江を下って呉軍を破り、張象を撃破していち早く石頭城を攻略、呉の末帝・孫皓の降伏を受け入れ、西晋による天下統一の大業を成し遂げた。官位は輔国大将軍に至った。しかし、先んじて孫皓の降伏を受け入れたことで上司の王渾の嫉妬を買った。晋の武帝は最終的に表向きこそ罪を問うたものの、実質的にはその功績を認めた。太康六年に病没し、武侯と諡された。","kr":"서진의 명장. 명문가 출신으로 박학다식하고 용모가 준수했으며, 지모가 뛰어나고 싸움에 능했다. 젊은 시절 하동종사를 지냈고, 훗날 정남장군 양호의 징벽을 받아 정남군사에 참여하자 양호가 막역한 지기로 대우했다. 칠순에 가까운 나이에 익주자사로 임명되어 진 무제의 명을 받들어 비밀리에 전함을 건축했다. 진나라가 오나라를 정벌할 때 당빈과 함께 장강을 따라 내려가며 오나라를 무찌르고 장상을 격퇴했으며, 가장 먼저 석두성을 함락시키고 오나라 마지막 황제 손호의 항복을 받아 서진의 통일 대업을 완수했다. 관직은 보국대장군에 이르렀다. 그러나 손호의 항복을 앞장서 받아낸 일로 상관 왕혼의 시기와 원한을 샀다. 진 무제는 결국 겉으로는 문책했으나 실제로는 그 공을 묵인하였고, 태강 6년에 병으로 세상을 떠나니 시호는 무후(武侯)이다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10465","remark":"","surname":"王","surnameTc":"王","surnameEn":"Wang","surnameJp":"王","surnameKr":"왕","surnameOther":"","name":"濬","nameTc":"濬","nameEn":"Jun","nameJp":"濬","nameKr":"준","nameOther":"","word":"士治","wordTc":"士治","wordEn":"Shizhi","wordJp":"士治","wordKr":"사치","wordOther":"","icon":"王濬","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"0","workYear":"225","city":"CS1029","gender":"0","rule":"91","force":"73","wise":"77","politics":"71","charm":"80","will":"83","ruleTalent":"11","forceTalent":"8","wiseTalent":"9","politicsTalent":"8","charmTalent":"6","willTalent":"11","weaponMaster":"76/28/74/28/28/60/50/28","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"1021702;1004902","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"S1000102;S1001905","battleSoul":"1020305","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"8500","battleSoulPoint":"5300","debateSoulPoint":"6000","strategy":"1011715","strategy2":"1000505;1010601;1000115","professions":"2/3/0/3/4/4/2/1/1/3/3/4/1/0/3/